15:00:31 [Data] ## BTC-USD News, from 2026-11-15 to 2026-11-22:  ### The Great Cash Grab Is Crashing Gold, Silver And Bitcoin, Goldman Sachs Warns The Stock Selloff Isn't Over (source: Stocktwits) The CME Group's FedWatch tool showed traders are pricing in an 88.6% chance of a Fed rate hike at its upcoming December meeting, making liquidity tighter. Link: https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/equity/why-gold-silver-and-bitcoin-are-crashing-together-the-great-cash-grab/cNbnYXsR91w  ### Average American spends $13 in Bitcoin, led by coffee (source: TheStreet) Here’s what nearly a year of Square data reveals about how Americans actually spend their Bitcoin. Link: https://www.thestreet.com/crypto/retail/average-american-spends-13-in-bitcoin-led-by-coffee  ### Coinbase's $21 children's book comes with $50 Bitcoin (source: TheStreet) Here’s why the exchange’s first children’s book sold out within a day. Link: https://www.thestreet.com/crypto/business/coinbases-21-childrens-book-comes-with-50-bitcoin  ### ETH Is One Small Dip Away From Trouble, But Analyst Calls Ethereum’s Strength Against Bitcoin ‘Incredibly Positive’ (source: Stocktwits) Both short and long clusters are within 3% of Ethereum’s current price, so a small move either way could decide which side gets squeezed first. Link: https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/cryptocurrency/eth-is-one-small-dip-away-from-trouble-but-analyst-calls-ethereum-s-strength-against-bitcoin-incredibly-positive/cNbnVa7R91t  ### 92-year-old burger chain says Bitcoin fuels 19% sales jump (source: TheStreet) Steak ‘n Shake says same-store sales are up more than 19% this quarter and credits Bitcoin payments. Link: https://www.thestreet.com/crypto/retail/92-year-old-burger-chain-says-bitcoin-fuels-19-sales-jump  ### JPMorgan Says Bitcoin Miners May Be Selling Reserves After BTC Falls $26K Below Mining Cost Estimate: Report (source: Stocktwits) BTC needs to rally about 44% from its current price to reach the $86,000 level, JPM’s estimate of a coin’s mining cost. Link: https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/cryptocurrency/jp-morgan-says-bitcoin-miners-may-be-selling-reserves-after-btc-falls-26-k-below-mining-cost-estimate-report/cNbnlZrR91A  ### Quant Funds Are ‘Shorting’ Bitcoin Below $60K, Jordi Visser Says: Here’s When He’ll Buy More (source: Stocktwits) While top companies in the USA continued to be hacked, Visser proposes the advantage of BTC, which he says has never been hacked. Link: https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/cryptocurrency/quant-funds-are-shorting-bitcoin-below-60-k-jordi-visser-says-here-s-when-he-ll-buy-more/cNbnS8rR91p  ### Arthur Hayes Says Bitcoin's Break Below Local Low Puts $50,000 In Play If Nasdaq Keeps Falling (source: Stocktwits) Arthur Hayes called Anthropic's Nasdaq debut a big moment for crypto. Link: https://stocktwits.com/news-articles/markets/cryptocurrency/arthur-hayes-says-bitcoin-s-break-below-local-low-puts-50-000-in-play-if-nasdaq-keeps-falling/cNbnivXR91o  ### CleanSpark Stock Slides On Bitcoin Weakness Ahead Of Earnings (source: Simply Wall St.) CleanSpark is facing pressure as investors react to weaker bitcoin prices, a pending fourth quarter earnings release, and questions around its Texas data center expansion and financing. The key operational tension is between a large, largely unleased Texas power footprint and a higher debt load that depends on future tenant commitments and mining revenue. This article examines how CleanSpark's investment profile, particularly its Texas data center exposure, aligns with the latest... Link: https://finance.yahoo.com/markets/stocks/articles/cleanspark-stock-slides-bitcoin-weakness-031019653.html  ### Nvidia Falls 48% From Peak as AI Selloff Spreads to Bitcoin and Crypto (source: CryptoProwl) Nvidia (NASDAQ: $NVDA) plunged 14% on Friday and the Nasdaq Composite lost 5.3%, capping the index's worst week... Link: https://www.cryptoprowl.com/releases/nvidia-falls-48-from-peak-as-ai-selloff-spreads-to-bitcoin-and-crypto-8017  ### At 74, a Machinist Planned to Pay for His Nursing Home With $150,000 in Bitcoin. After the Crash It’s Worth About $90,000, and the Loss Will Get Him Onto Medicaid About 5½ Months Sooner (source: 24/7 Wall St.) A market crash can erase a retiree's nest egg, yet Medicaid's strict look-back rules treat that loss very differently from a gift. One wrong move by his family could turn a bad break into a penalty period with no coverage. Link: https://247wallst.com/personal-finance/2026/11/21/at-74-a-machinist-planned-to-pay-for-his-nursing-home-with-150000-in-bitcoin-after-the-crash-its-worth-about-90000-and-the-loss-will-get-him-onto-medicaid-about-5%c2%bd-months-sooner/  ### Some bought Bitcoin for under $20,000 over the weekend (source: TheStreet) Kraken’s Canadian-dollar market gave some buyers an unusual opening. Here’s what the prices were worth in U.S. dollars. Link: https://www.thestreet.com/crypto/markets/some-bought-bitcoin-on-kraken-for-under-20000  ### Fidelity flags costly tax mistake before year-end (source: TheStreet) Here’s what crypto owners should check before their next tax form arrives. Link: https://www.thestreet.com/crypto/investing/fidelity-flags-costly-tax-mistake-before-year-end  ### Bitcoin Bounces Off Two-Year Lows. Could Crypto Rescue Stocks on Monday? (source: Barrons.com) The price of Bitcoin has climbed more than 3% over the past 24 hours and is rebounding from two-year lows. That might be a good sign for the stock market on Monday. Link: https://www.barrons.com/articles/bitcoin-price-today-news-2098674f?siteid=yhoof2&yptr=yahoo  ### $1,000 in Anthropic Stock or XRP: Which Could Be Worth More in 5 Years? (source: 24/7 Wall St.) One bet comes from the biggest IPO ever, and the other from a coin that keeps bleeding. Both could multiply a $1,000 stake, but only one carries a catch that makes the math far more brutal than it looks. Link: https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/11/21/1000-in-anthropic-stock-or-xrp-which-could-be-worth-more-in-5-years/  ### MSCI Is Cutting Strategy and Metaplanet From Its Indexes. Here's What It Means for Bitcoin Treasury Company Stocks. (source: Motley Fool) MSCI is booting Strategy from its indexes at the end of November. What does that mean for Bitcoin treasury stocks? Link: https://www.fool.com/investing/2026/11/21/msci-is-cutting-strategy-and-metaplanet-from-its-indexes-here-s-what-it-means-for-bitcoin-treasury-company-stocks/  ### Better Buy: Bitcoin vs. Ethereum (source: Motley Fool) Which one of the world’s top cryptocurrencies is a better investment today? Link: https://www.fool.com/investing/2026/11/21/better-buy-bitcoin-vs-ethereum/  ### Fraudsters Used Fake Crypto Exchanges to Steal $37 Million, SEC Alleges (source: decrypt) The agency says eight Colorado-registered entities, likely run from overseas, posed as legitimate advisers and crypto platforms—even faking SEC certificates and filings—to defraud U.S. investors of more than $37 million. Link: https://decrypt.co/383752/fraudsters-fake-crypto-exchanges-steal-37-million-sec  ### ChatGPT AI Predicts XRP’s Price for the End of 2029 (source: 24/7 Wall St.) XRP has sunk to its lowest close in a year, yet ChatGPT sees a long climb ahead and gives Standard Chartered's far bolder target a surprisingly slim chance. Two big conditions decide whether the bullish math survives. Link: https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/11/21/chatgpt-ai-predicts-xrps-price-for-the-end-of-2029/  ### Anthropic Is Now Worth More Than Bitcoin: Could Bitcoin Pass It by 2030? (source: 24/7 Wall St.) A company that went public just days ago has already passed the world's biggest cryptocurrency in value. Bitcoin faces ETF outflows, a looming Fed meeting, and a steep climb, so what would it take to win the lead back? Link: https://247wallst.com/investing/cryptocurrency/2026/11/21/anthropic-is-now-worth-more-than-bitcoin-could-bitcoin-pass-it-by-2030/
